        "text": "And since whatever is moved by anything per se and not accidentally, is directed thereby towards the end of its movement;? and since the heavenly body is moved by an intellectual substance; and the heavenly body, by its movement, causes all movement in this lower world; it follows of necessity that the heavenly body is directed to the end of its movement, by an intellectual substance, and consequently all lower bodies to their respective ends."
