        "text": "Again. It was proved above’ that the divine operation does not exclude the operations of secondary causes. And whatever is effected by the operations of secondary causes, is subject to divine providence, since God directs all individual things by Himself, as was proved above.? Therefore secondary causes execute divine providence."
